eted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.6.2.stable\n\n### System information\n\nMac - Godot 4.6.2.stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen renaming an Autoload, the old node name for the Autoload stays in the code suggestion popup until the editor is restarted.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new script.\n2. Add it to Autoloads (Project -> Project Settings -> Globals -> Autoload).\n3. Verify in code that the autoload name appears as a suggestion in the code suggestion popup when typing in a script.\n4. Go back to the Autoload menu and change the Name of the autoload.\n5. Go back to a script and start typing the old name of the autoload and see that it still appears in code suggestion. Try to type the new name of the autoload and see that it also appears in code suggestion.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-proj.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28254546/test-proj.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https:/